; HF-D3 reproducer: read_line buffers a whole line without charging the memory budget.
; Expected: LIMIT_EXCEEDED at READ_LINE for a line larger than --max-memory-bytes
; (READ_STDIN already fails at its own opcode).
; Observed: a 32 MiB line is accepted under --max-memory-bytes 1048576.
(cli_app
  (let (line (read_line))
    (print "read_line accepted a line larger than the memory budget")))
